{"product_id":"the-winter-king","title":"The Winter King","description":"\u003cb\u003eIn the Dark Ages, a legendary warrior struggles to unite Britain ...\u003c\/b\u003e\n\nUther, the High King of Britain, has died, leaving the infant Mordred as his only heir. His uncle, the loyal and gifted warlord Arthur, now rules as caretaker for a country which has fallen into chaos â threats emerge from within the British kingdoms while vicious Saxon armies stand ready to invade. As he struggles to unite Britain and hold back the enemy at the gates, Arthur is embroiled in a doomed romance with beautiful Guinevere. Will the old-world magic of Merlin be enough to turn the tide of war in his favour?\n\nThe first of Bernard Cornwell's Warlord Chronicles, \u003ci\u003eThe Winter King\u003c\/i\u003e sheds new light on the Arthurian legend, combining myth with historical accuracy and the brutal action of the battlefield. \n Dimensions:110 x 180  \n Author: Bernard Cornwell \n ISBN: 9780140231861 \n Format: Trade Paperback \n Pages 512","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44933304778905,"sku":"8RC9780140231861","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c431e0219e5f6d572f9d9a435e5d9b36.jpg?v=1730469918","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-winter-king","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}